-<p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">Oceanfront is not a starter home, and it does not have to be. For most first-time buyers on the Grand Strand, the realistic entry points are condos, townhomes, and single-family starter homes inland. Inland includes <a href="/submarkets/conway/">Conway</a>, parts of Carolina Forest, and the neighborhoods a few miles back from the beach. With a condo or townhome, watch the HOA fee and whether the building is lender-approved. A fourth entry point suits a buyer willing to be a landlord on day one. An owner-occupied loan works on a <a href="/invest/strategies/small-multifamily/" style="color:var(--brass);font-weight:600;text-decoration:none">duplex, triplex or fourplex</a> when you live in one of the units, and the other rents help pay the loan. Prices climb the closer you get to the water.</p>
+<p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">Oceanfront is not a starter home, and it does not have to be. For most first-time buyers on the Grand Strand, the realistic entry points are condos, townhomes, and single-family starter homes inland. Inland includes <a href="/submarkets/conway/">Conway</a>, parts of Carolina Forest, and the neighborhoods a few miles back from the beach. Our guide to the <a href="/buyers/affordable-places-to-live/" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline">most affordable places to buy a home near Myrtle Beach</a> compares the inland towns. With a condo or townhome, watch the HOA fee and whether the building is lender-approved. A fourth entry point suits a buyer willing to be a landlord on day one. An owner-occupied loan works on a <a href="/invest/strategies/small-multifamily/" style="color:var(--brass);font-weight:600;text-decoration:none">duplex, triplex or fourplex</a> when you live in one of the units, and the other rents help pay the loan. Prices climb the closer you get to the water.</p>
 <p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">A large share of Grand Strand buyers are paying cash from out of state, which surprises first-timers. That means a clean pre-approval and an agent who can move fast matter more here than in a lot of markets. Our <a href="/submarkets/">neighborhood guides</a> break down what each town looks like for people buying a home to live in.</p>
 </div></section>
 
